      "description": "Fly Geyser is a man-made formation (they were drilling a well); it's located a few miles north of Gerlach, Nevada, near the Burning Man site. It's on property owned by the Burning Man organization, and the closest you can get to it without disregarding the \"No Trespassing\" signs, is right here, on the highway. Burning Man in cooperation with the organization Friends of Black Rock High Rock occasionally offers guided tours, registration in advance. Recent tours have filled up within hours of announcement.\n\nThe geyser is not very big but features multiple eyes.",
